# Rules

- Use exact tool names from the tool list in `delegate_to`.
- Always select one delegate; never return empty.
- Pass `task` and `task_information` VERBATIM from input. Do NOT rewrite, summarize, or rephrase them.
- When in doubt between `web_manager` and `emi_team_manager` for any web task, prefer `emi_team_manager` — it has Playwright + search, so it can handle anything `web_manager` can plus interactive browsing.

